  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="5.3">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IVAtr">IV Atr</ref> 5.3</head>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="la" source="#liebermann" n="5.3" corresp="#wit-q">Et constituerunt, monetarii cur manum perdant, et ponatur super ipsius monete fabricam.</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="la" source="#robertson" n="5.3" corresp="#wit-q">Et constituerunt, monetarii cur manum perdant et ponatur super ipsius monetae fabricam.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#robertson" corresp="#wit-q">And they have decreed that coiners shall lose a hand, and that it shall be fastened up over the mint.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="de" source="#liebermann">Und sie haben festgesetzt, dass [Falsch]münzer die Hand verlieren, und diese über jener Münzschmiede angebracht werde.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude" ana="#fromGerman">And they have established that [false] moneyers lose their hand, and that it be fixed over that mint.</ab>
        <note type="comparedBy" source="#liebermann"><ref target="clause:IVAtr_9-1">IV Atr 9.1</ref></note>
      </div>
    </body>
